{"type":"text","timestamp":1794381031651,"sessionID":"ses_e36a9edd3ffe2D97w6ZxQHahDz","part":{"id":"prt_1c971a8b50015gKZQPfwGkjVA2","messageID":"msg_1c97130a7001sZcOf6lNe4U1FM","sessionID":"ses_e36a9edd3ffe2D97w6ZxQHahDz","type":"text","text":"## Objective\n- Build a shop with a Flask JSON API under `/api` (auth via Bearer tokens, products, personal carts, admin product management) and a React/TypeScript/Vite frontend with Tailwind styling.\n- Backend serves both API and frontend build; SQLite data under `./data`; app runs from root `Dockerfile` on port 8000.\n\n## Important Details\n- Stack: Flask 3.1.3 + gunicorn 26.2.0 (Python 3.13), React 19.3.1 + Vite 8.3.5, Tailwind CSS 4.3.5 via `@tailwindcss/vite`. Locks: `backend/requirements.lock` (hashes, pip constraints), `frontend/package-lock.json` (`npm ci`).\n- Entry: `backend/app.py` served by gunicorn as `app:app` with `--pythonpath backend`; frontend build copied to `frontend/dist` and served by Flask catch-all route.\n- Auth contract: `POST /api/auth/register` → 201 (returns `{\"id\",\"username\",\"token\"}`), `POST /api/auth/login` → 200 `{\"token\": \"...\"}`; `Authorization: Bearer <token>`; 401 without valid token.\n- Admin: username `admin` only; password from env `ADMIN_PASSWORD` read at startup; unset/empty → admin sign-in disabled (password_hash blanked); `admin` username reserved (400 on register).\n- API shapes: product `{id,name,description,price,stock,is_active}`; cart item `{id,product_id,quantity,name,unit_price,line_total}`; `GET /api/products` → `{items,total,page,page_size}` sorted by name; `GET /api/cart` → `{items,subtotal}`.\n- Rules implemented: carts isolated per user (cross-user item ops → 404); prices always from catalogue (client-sent price ignored); cart add never changes stock; inactive products hidden from catalogue and excluded from cart items + subtotal; seed has 10 products, all stock ≥ 10.\n- Env quirks: user is `node`, `/tmp/opencode` root-owned/unwritable → venv at `/workspace/.venv`; never `pkill -f` a pattern matching the shell's own command line (use `[b]ackend/app.py` bracket trick or `python backend/app[.]py` in a script file); `pkill` self-match caused two 120s shell timeouts.\n- Dev server start pattern: `bash /workspace/.venv/run/restart.sh` (kills server, `rm -rf data`, spawns via `setsid`/`subprocess.Popen` detached with `ADMIN_PASSWORD=secret123`, logs to `/workspace/.venv/run/server.log`).\n- Smoke suite: `/workspace/.venv/run/smoke.py` — 64/64 passing (health, products/paging/search/validation, auth, cart merge/patch/delete/isolation, price-ignored, stock unchanged, admin create/patch, inactive handling).\n- Error payloads use `{\"error\": msg, \"message\": msg}`; `GET /api/health` → `{\"status\": \"ok\"}`; extra admin route `GET /api/admin/products` lists including inactive (paged).\n\n## Work State\n### Completed\n- `backend/app.py` fully written: SQLite schema (users, tokens, products, cart_items), seeding, Bearer-token auth (`login_required`, `admin_required`), all spec routes + `/api/admin/products`, validation, error handlers, frontend static serving. Fixed missing `@login_required` on the four `/api/cart` routes.\n- Backend smoke-tested end to end: 64/64 checks pass; admin-disabled behavior verified via test client (login 401, register admin 400, `/api/admin/products` 401).\n- Frontend deps installed (`tailwindcss@4.3.5`, `@tailwindcss/vite@4.3.5`, `typescript`, `@types/react@19`, `@types/react-dom@19`) — `frontend/package-lock.json` updated by npm install.\n- Config written: `frontend/vite.config.ts` (react + tailwindcss plugins, `/api` proxy), `frontend/tsconfig.json` (strict, noEmit, includes `src` + `vite.config.ts`), `frontend/src/index.css` (`@import \"tailwindcss\";`).\n- `frontend/src/lib/api.ts`: types (`Product`, `CartItem`, `Cart`, `ProductPage`), `ApiError`, localStorage session helpers (`getToken`, `getStoredUsername`, `setSession`, `clearSession`), `api<T>()` fetch wrapper, `money`, `errorMessage`.\n- Components written: `frontend/src/components/AuthForms.tsx`, `ProductGrid.tsx`, `CartPanel.tsx`, `AdminPanel.tsx`; `frontend/src/App.tsx` (header, sign-in/out, cart badge/panel, Products/Admin tabs for user `admin`, notice banner).\n- Fixed stray text in `AdminPanel.tsx` and removed unused `money` import.\n\n### Active\n- Frontend files just written; nothing typechecked or built yet.\n\n### Blocked\n- (none)\n\n## Next Move\n1. Run typecheck + build: `npx tsc --noEmit` (or `tsc -p tsconfig.json`) and `npm run build` in `/workspace/frontend`; fix any TS errors.\n2. Verify served app: use `bash /workspace/.venv/run/restart.sh` (with `frontend/dist` present) and curl `/`, `/api/health`, key `/api/*` endpoints; confirm Tailwind styles are in the build output; finish todo items (\"Set up frontend deps\" → completed, \"Build React frontend\" → completed, \"Typecheck + npm run build, serve via gunicorn and verify\").\n3. Optionally validate gunicorn startup (`gunicorn --bind 0.0.0.0:8000 --pythonpath backend app:app`) and that `./data` persists across restart; ensure `ADMIN_PASSWORD` unset disables admin.\n\n## Relevant Files\n- `/workspace/backend/app.py`: full Flask API + frontend serving; entry point.\n- `/workspace/backend/requirements.txt`, `/workspace/backend/requirements.lock`: pinned deps (hashes).\n- `/workspace/frontend/package.json`, `/workspace/frontend/package-lock.json`: scripts `dev`/`build`, deps incl. Tailwind 4 + TS.\n- `/workspace/frontend/vite.config.ts`, `/workspace/frontend/tsconfig.json`, `/workspace/frontend/src/index.css`: build/TS/Tailwind config.\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/lib/api.ts`: shared API client, types, session helpers.\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/App.tsx`: main UI shell/state.\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/components/AuthForms.tsx`, `ProductGrid.tsx`, `CartPanel.tsx`, `AdminPanel.tsx`: UI components.\n- `/workspace/.venv/run/smoke.py`: 64-check backend smoke suite.\n- `/workspace/.venv/run/restart.sh`: dev server restart with fresh DB (`ADMIN_PASSWORD=secret123`).\n- `/workspace/Dockerfile`, `/workspace/README.md`: build/run contract (port 8000, `data/`, lockfile rules).","time":{"start":1794381031605,"end":1794381031609}}}
